    "text": "Scranton\nConey Island Lunch set to reopen in 2026 with a nod to the past\n7 hours ago\nSCRANTON, Pa. — Behind sheets of plywood and poured concrete walls sits what will be the original but improved home of Coney Island Lunch on Lackawanna Avenue in Scranton. \"We actually have the original recipes, and that's very exciting for us to kind of bring this back alive,\" said Sheila Bonanno, the operations director for Basalyga Hospitality.\n7",
